<title>USA: Spatializer Audio names Bolcerek CFO.</title>
<headline>Spatializer Audio names Bolcerek CFO.</headline>
<dateline>WOODLAND HILLS, Calif. 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spatializer Audio Laboratories Inc Monday said it named Michael Bolcerek as its Chief Financial Officer.</p>
<p>Spatializer did not say whom Bolcerek replaces and a spokeswoman was not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said Bolcerek has over 14 years of experience in finance management for technology companies.</p>
<p>Spatializer develops audio and data storage products.</p>
</text>
